SHIPPED — what is on disk today

File: openOODA/SHIPPED.oot
One page. What you can run right now.
DESIGN is the want list. SPRINT is this week. PM is the pin.
Read the code if a row here is old.

REAL

Product path: the seed (trusted first oodac binary), then gcc.

  Compiler loop
    oodac check, emit-c, run / ooda CLI

  Self-host floor
    Backend-C: emit C, link the C runtime (chs_rt), then gcc, via the seed

  File seals
    read_file, write_file, path_exists, file_size
    Tokens: FsReadCap, FsWriteCap (old FsCap still accepted)

  Net seals
    fetch uses HttpCap
    TCP / UDP / bind slot IO uses TcpCap, UdpCap, BindCap

  Process exec
    sys_exec and process_exec use ProcessCap (or SysCap)

  Process args and walk
    process_args(ProcessCap) in ../ooda/std/os/process.oo
    fs_walk(FsReadCap) in ../ooda/std/os/fs.oo

  Env, time, rand, alloc
    EnvCap (OODA_ and OO_ keys)
    TimeCap, RandCap, AllocCap

  Threads
    mutex, spawn, join, channels — ThreadCap

  GPU gate
    gpu_launch + GpuCap (CPU / noop path today)

  Type-state
    // TYPESTATE: Type S1 S2
    // TYPESTATE fn name: From -> To
    Check refuses a wrong lifecycle.
    if/else and match arms join. Alias and s.connect() share the name.
    States belong to a type. main honors TYPESTATE end. Imports keep directives.

  Contracts
    requires / ensures, simple runtime, && works

  Secrets
    SECRET: checked at compile time. Separate from Caps.

  CPU bound
    MAX_CYCLES: N on while, for, and recursion

  Agent tools
    outline, reflect, --json-errors, patch, ooda fix (bounded classes)

  Memory
    ARC frees when the last ref drops (default PURE_NO_ARC=0)

  Path-A decoys
    Path-a is the small decoy path: fake pads so memory offsets change.
    METAMORPHIC: path-a emits __oo_meta_decoy_*
    meta_epoch() exists

  Std product
    ../ooda/std facades for fs, net, process
    Count the .oo files when you need a number.

Ops: ../ooda/bootstrap/CAPS_MATRIX.oot
Token names: CAPS.oot


SIDE SLICE

These files exist. They are their own units.

  Load-time hide
    ../ooda/runtime/oo_hide.c
    OODA_HIDE=1 fills a 16-slot table at process start

  Merkle helper
    ../ooda/runtime/oo_holo.c and oo_sha256.c
    Persist and load a blob with a hash root

  Editor helper
    ../vscode/ — ooda-lsp, started through vscode-languageclient
    Hover uses the open file and fn at the cursor
    Diagnostics come from oodac check

  Grammar probe
    ../tree-sitter/grammar.js — parse probe in that tree


